The game tells you they're statues, but they're not.  They're statue
traps, and probably appear about as frequently as any other trap.  If
you have intrinsic searching (like a high-level Archeologist or an Elf,
I think), you will sometimes "find" these traps, with the message "You
find a <monster> posing as a statue."

